"answer": "Project Zenith is an initiative focused on implementing AI algorithms to increase efficiency by 20%. The project has secured a strategic partnership with TechInnovate to leverage their AI technology. The team has expanded with new members specializing in cybersecurity, cloud architecture, machine learning, and cloud computing. A major milestone was reached with the successful testing of a secure file sharing prototype, with UI enhancements planned for October. Feedback on the prototype is being sought from stakeholders by the end of November. Security protocols, including multi-factor authentication and encryption, are being updated effective January next year. However, one email indicates that the project has been cancelled."
